      "tex": "diagram-04.tex",
      "title": "The common quotient of the relation supports",
      "alt": "The relation carrier M maps surjectively to B by a and to G by b-prime. B maps down to B by its identity, G maps down to G/A by q_A, and beta maps B to G/A across the bottom. The diagram commutes: beta composed with a equals q_A composed with b-prime. Here a(b,y) = b, b-prime(b,y) = y, and beta(b) = b+A.",
